    "fullKannadaSub": "dau mdu dodda haagoo jnarida thubada sinimaa mmdira. hlavrau thmama seetuglalli kulithu dodda skreen maele sinimaa noduththiddaare. lalai kepau haagoo kpapau bnanada meduvaada seetuglavae. godeglau kepaagadadau seeliga‌nlalai snana laituglavae. sinimaa arabhavaaglau lalaroo asakthiyida kaayuththiddaare.",
